        "body": "$\\left\\{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\left[\\begin{array}{l}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{array}\\right], \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\left[\\begin{array}{r}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{array}\\right],\\left[\\begin{array}{l}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{array}\\right]\\right\\}$",
